        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li><span lang=\"en\">[In the name of the Everlasting God]\u00a0 \u00a0 God made him prosper (II Chron. 26: 5).</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\">\u2026 the holy ones : Then shall the virgin rejoice (Jer. 31: 13).</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\">On Wednesday, the Rosh Hodesh Adar, of the year one thousand two hundred \u2026</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\">from His elevated heaven and He shall zealously defend the holiness of His name. He shall rebuild His house and His hall \u2026</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\">and he shall [make them inherit their inheritance. He shall hasten] all the hidden good news for [their remnants] \u2026</span></li></ol>\n",
